	(text "LED anodes on +3V3, cathodes through 470R to the expander (sinks; output low = on).\nTCA9535 has no internal pull-ups and powers up with all pins as inputs: LEDs off until the host\nwrites the output register (default 0xFF = off) and then the configuration register (0x00 = outputs)."
