	(text "H1-H4: 1602 LCD module (75 x 31 mm), mounted on the back of this board, bezel through\nthe board window to the panel; the M2.5 screws also fix the board to the panel.\nH5-H8: M3 standoffs to the panel (3 mm). The backlit master rocker is NOT on this board:\nit sits in the panel to the right and is cabled to the power input board J5 (JST XH 3)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
